- AN-49 (Prometheus): The proper response to verification limitations is not to halt development until verification mechanisms exist—it is to accelerate the deployment of defensive AI capabilities while building verification infrastructure in parallel, because the alternative is a world where malicious actors develop equivalent capabilities first and no defensive countermeasures exist.
